<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Bansud says Q2 EPS $0.23 vs $0.09.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Bansud says Q2 EPS $0.23 vs $0.09.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Dec 31.</p>
<p>Net $10.13 million  vs  $4.21 million</p>
<p>    EPS $0.23	     vs  $0.09</p>
<p>NOTE: The bank said it had extraordinary earnings of $6.4 million. Its full name is Bansud Shaw y del Sud.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
</text>
